														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1875570">
									

<p>It needs to either deviate from the formula of Night Vale enough to make it more Foundationesq, include more Foundation stuff and still be a direct episode of Night Vale, or otherwise include an actual story to it. You could probably create an actual audio recording of this by cutting and splicing long sections of extant Night Vale episodes.</p>

