														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2108042">
									

<p>It needs more Foundation. This is plain old generic Night Vale. There's no research, no discussions name dropping anomalous objects, low hume levels, MTFs or 'Euclid'. The white vans don't even have 'Specialty Cake Providers' on them. There's not even any major signs of anomalous activity, no significant reason for the Foundation to have a presence. It's not really a crossover at all.</p>
<p>Though the scientists spoke amongst themselves in close, hushed tones, acting as though I were not even present, twice I overheard them mutter the word 'Euclid'. Whatever that means, listeners.</p>

